<item>
            <title>[ZEPPELIN-5342] zeppelin.sh freezes foreve in the busy loop is I&apos;m passing unsupported argument</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-5342</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;If I&apos;m erroneously calling &lt;tt&gt;zeppelin.sh&lt;/tt&gt; script like {{zeppelin.sh}}start` it just freezes.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;tt&gt;bash -x zeppelin.sh start&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;outputs primarily the following:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;{{&lt;br/&gt;
+ key=run&lt;br/&gt;
 + case $key in&lt;br/&gt;
 + [[ 1 -gt 0 ]]&lt;br/&gt;
 + key=run&lt;br/&gt;
 + case $key in&lt;br/&gt;
 + [[ 1 -gt 0 ]]&lt;br/&gt;
 + key=run&lt;br/&gt;
 + case $key in&lt;br/&gt;
 + [[ 1 -gt 0 ]]&lt;br/&gt;
 + key=run&lt;br/&gt;
 + case $key in&lt;br/&gt;
 + [[ 1 -gt 0 ]]&lt;br/&gt;
 + key=run&lt;br/&gt;
 + case $key in&lt;br/&gt;
 + [[ 1 -gt 0 ]]&lt;br/&gt;
 + key=run&lt;br/&gt;
 + case $key in&lt;br/&gt;
}}&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;until I&apos;ll hit Ctrl+C&lt;/p&gt;</description>
